<title>UK: TABLE - Nat Grid says adj profits up 12.2 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Nat Grid says adj profits up 12.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 24.3		  vs    25.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   6.68		 vs     n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  11.13		 vs    10.27</p>
<p> Pretax		     591.4		  vs   616.5</p>
<p> Turnover		 1,457.5		  vs 1,487.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 577 and 597 million stg. After adjusting for the effects of the capital reconstruction prior to listing, the group said pretax profit rose by 12.2 percent while adjusted pro-forma EPS rose 6.1 percent.</p>
<p>Full company name - National Grid Group Plc</p>
</text>
